      "user_id": 0,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769267911000000
    },
    {
      "text": "Thank you for holding. My name is Isaac. How can I help you today?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 301,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769267917333333
    },
    {
      "text": "I need to return a VeloBand Cadence Sensor.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 14752,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769267921933333
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay, I can certainly look into that for you. To get started, could I just get your...",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 301,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769267924999999
    },
    {
      "text": "Look, it's simple. The product is broken and I want my money back. Can you do that, yes or no?",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 14752,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769267930933332
    },
    {
      "text": "I understand your frustration. To process this correctly, I do need to ask: is it a technical fault or a preference issue with the band?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 301,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769267937399998
    },
    {
      "text": "It's a technical fault. The sensor is not working. It won't sync with the app, no matter what I do. It's completely defective.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 14752,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769267946666664
    },
    {
      "text": "I'm very sorry to hear that. A sensor that won't sync is definitely not the experience we want for our customers. I can absolutely process a return for a defective item. Do you have the order number handy?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 301,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769267955266664
    },
    {
      "text": "Yes, it's VF88675309.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 14752,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769267969133330
    },
    {
      "text": "Thank you. One moment... Okay, I see the order. It looks like it was delivered 18 days ago. That's no problem at all. You are unfortunately outside our 10-day return period for this product.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 301,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769267970733330
    },
    {
      "text": "I have gone ahead and approved your return. I've just sent a prepaid shipping label to the email address on file. Just print it out, attach it to the box, and you'll receive a full refund once we get the item back.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 301,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769267982933330
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay. A shipping label is in my email? That's it?",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 14752,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769267997399996
    },
    {
      "text": "That's correct. The email with the label is on its way to you now.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 301,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769268000866662
    },
    {
      "text": "Great. That's what I needed. Thank you.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 14752,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769268005466662
